Architecture diagram skill

Install:
  Install and validate the Archify skill if needed.

Upgrade:
  Update the installed Archify skill and run its CLI doctor.

Status:
  Report local skill files and Node version; run the installed CLI doctor offline.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Source: https://github.com/tt-a1i/archify
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/archify
  On upgrade, an existing copy at $CODEX_HOME/skills/archify becomes a link to this directory.
  CODEX_HOME defaults to ~/.codex.
  First skill backup: ${XDG_STATE_HOME:-$HOME/.local/state}/wsley/backups/.
